<attribute name="sectionName" nodeId="bca247b4"></attribute>
<attribute name="sectionDescription" nodeId="5b1a1565">&lt;p&gt;
    Schedule requirement gathering sessions with reporting stakeholders.&lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;br /&gt;
    It is important to include representatives from all SDLC teams (development, testing, etc.) to&amp;nbsp;confirm timely and
    consistent understanding of requirements and source system Subject Matter Experts (SMEs) to clarify any questions about
    data granularity, data quality and data relationships. Source system SMEs can also help vet the report mock-up design
    by providing inputs about the data aggregations and hierarchy.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    In the case of existing report enhancement, current reports are inventoried and analyzed to understand minute details
    about the data.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
